{
  "id": "25247_kuiru",
  "headword": "{悔|く}いる",
  "reading": "くいる",
  "romaji": "kuiru",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (ichidan)",
  "gloss": "to regret; to repent; to rue",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to regret; to repent; to rue",
      "explanation": "to feel remorse or deep regret about a past action or decision"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "25247_kuiru_ex1",
      "japanese": "{過去|かこ}を{悔|く}いても{仕方|しかた}がない。",
      "english": "There's no use regretting the past.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "25247_kuiru_ex2",
      "japanese": "{悔|く}いのない{人生|じんせい}を{送|おく}りたい。",
      "english": "I want to live a life without regrets.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "25247_kuiru_ex3",
      "japanese": "あの{時|とき}もっと{努力|どりょく}していればと{悔|く}いることがある。",
      "english": "Sometimes I regret not having tried harder back then.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "25247_kuiru_ex4",
      "japanese": "{彼|かれ}は{自分|じぶん}の{行|おこな}いを{深|ふか}く{悔|く}いていた。",
      "english": "He deeply regretted his actions.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "A literary verb expressing deep regret or remorse. More formal and weighty than {後悔|こうかい}する, and often used in reflective or written contexts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {過去|かこ}を{悔|く}いる: to regret the past\n- {行|おこな}いを{悔|く}いる: to regret one's actions\n- {悔|く}いのない: without regret\n- {悔|く}いても{悔|く}いきれない: to regret beyond words\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {後悔|こうかい}する: the most common way to say \"regret\" in everyday speech; {悔|く}いる is more literary and emotive\n- {悔|く}やむ: to feel regret or mourn a missed opportunity; often used about things outside one's control, while {悔|く}いる implies personal responsibility\n\nETYMOLOGY:\nThe kanji {悔|く} carries the meaning of regret and remorse. This verb shares its root with {悔|く}やむ and {悔|く}やしい.",
